		"A §6Blood Orb§r is one of the many tools needed by Blood Mages.",
		"",
		"Once crafted, §6right-click§r it while holding it in your hand to §6bind§r your soul to it. ",
		"",
		"The Blood Orb acts similar to the §6Sacrifical Dagger§r, it can consume some of your life essence by right-clicking after it has been bound.",
		"",
		"However, instead of releasing the life essence into the blood altar, it §6stores§r it in your §6soul network§r.",
		"",
		"This is an intangible place that can be accessed, and used, in many different ways.",
		"",
		"The orb can also be §6placed§r into a blood altar, where it will §6drain§r the life essence from the altar, and store it in the network."
